---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Subscription terms — nightlife.dev" description="Terms for the nightlife.dev Pro API subscription.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6 px-6 py-16 leading-relaxed">
    <a href="/" class="text-primary hover:underline">&larr; nightlife.dev</a>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Pro subscription terms</h1>
    <p class="text-text-muted">Pro costs US$29 per month. Stripe processes your payment and automatically renews the subscription monthly until you cancel. The price and any applicable tax are shown before payment.</p>
    <p class="text-text-muted">Pro includes up to 3 API keys, with 1,000 requests per day and 60 requests per minute per key. Daily quotas reset at midnight UTC. API access remains subject to available data, service availability, and rate limits. Event details can change; confirm booking and admission information with the venue.</p>
    <p class="text-text-muted">Cancel through “Manage billing” in your dashboard. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the paid billing period; Pro remains available until then. Failed or overdue payments may return your account to Free limits.</p>
    <p class="text-text-muted">For billing mistakes, refund requests, or support, contact <a class="text-primary underline" href="mailto:allen@nightlifetokyo.com">allen@nightlifetokyo.com</a>. Refunds are reviewed individually, subject to applicable law.</p>
    <p class="text-text-muted">We store your account ID, Stripe customer and subscription references, subscription status, checkout source, and checkout/payment timestamps to provide access and measure checkout conversion. Card details are handled by Stripe and are not stored in the API database.</p>
    <a href="/checkout" class="inline-block text-primary hover:underline">Back to Pro &rarr;</a>
  </main>
</Base>
